<p class="heading" style="text-align:justify">And the VENDOR/Developer hereby admitted and acknowledged the receipt of entire sale consideration. The VENDOR/Developer hereby convey, sell, transfer and assign all their title, right and interest over the Schedule “B” Property together with rights of easements and appurtenances unto and to the use of the VENDEE(S).</p>
<ol class="clauses">
<li>That the Vendor has this day delivered the vacant, physical and peaceful possession of the Schedule “B” mentioned Property to the VENDEE(S) “TO HAVE AND TO HOLD” the same absolutely and forever, which is more fully and specifically delineated and described in Schedule “B” Property.</li>
<li>That the Vendor has paid all taxes, cess, dues etc., in respect of the Schedule Mentioned Property up to the date of registration of Sale Deed.</li>
<li>That the rights, titles, interests, easements, privileges, appurtenances, liberties, enjoyments and possessions are hereby transferred and subsist in favour of the VENDEE(S) absolutely and forever.</li>
<li>That the Vendor hereby declare and covenant with the VENDEE(S) that the Schedule Mentioned Property is free from all encumbrances, charges, prior sales, gifts, mortgages, liens, court attachments and litigations etc., and the Vendor has full power and absolute authority to sell the Schedule “B” Property to the VENDEE(S) absolutely and forever.</li>
<li>That the VENDOR hereby undertakes to indemnify and keep the VENDEE(S) indemnified against all the losses, costs, expenses, damages sustained if any to the VENDEE(S) on account of any defect in title of Vendor or if the VENDEE(S) are deprived from the part or whole of the Schedule “B” Property, the Vendor shall compensate against the same at all times.</li>
<li>That the Vendor further declare and covenant with the VENDEE(S) that it will execute any further deeds of assurance to strengthen the title of the VENDEE(S) at the cost and expenses of the VENDEE(S).</li>
<li>The VENDEE(S) shall be the joint owner of the schedule land and terrace along with other flat owners of the building complex and the land and terrace are for the common use of all the Flat Owners of the building complex.</li>
<li>The VENDEE(S) shall not injure, tamper or damage any part of the structure or any part of the building nor shall be made any additions or alterations in the building without the written permission of the Vendor/Land Owner or other body that may be formed of the owners of the apartments etc.,</li>
<li>That the VENDEE(S) hereby agree that the name of the apartment as “ANANDA THE DRIZZLE”, which the Vendor has given to the said building and shall be retained by the VENDEE(S) and the Society of the Co-Operative body that may be formed by the VENDEE(S) of the said tenement in the said building and that the said name shall not be changed.</li>
<li>The Vendor/Land Owner has produced all required Documents, Plans and Permissions before the VENDEE(S). The VENDEE(S) having verified all documents, Plans, Permissions and specifications etc., and having satisfied himself/herself and decided to purchase the Schedule “B” Property, as the VENDEE(S) shall not make any claim or dispute regarding the above aspect in future.</li>
<li>The Land Owner(s) hereby declare that the site described in Schedule “A” Property is not an assigned land within the meaning of A.P. Assigned Lands (Prohibition and Transfers) Act 9 of 1977 and it is also not sold to any body or under mortgage to Govt., /Agencies/Undertakings.</li>
<li>The VENDEE(S) shall keep and maintain the building in a decent and civilized manner and shall do his/her/their part in maintaining the living standards of the Apartment occupiers at a high level to this Interlay, the VENDEE(S):
<ol class="roman">
<li>Shall not throw Dirt, Rubbish etc., on any open place/space/compound etc., not meant for the purpose.</li>
<li>Shall not use the Apartment space for any illegal or immoral purposes.</li>
<li>Shall not use the Apartment in such manner which may cause nuisance disturbance or difficulty to the Occupiers of this Apartment etc.,</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
<p class="heading" style="text-align:left">TO HAVE PEACEFUL OCCUPATION OF THE BUILDING COMPLEX THE VENDEE(S) HEREBY COVENANTS AS FOLLOWS: -</p>
<ol class="clauses">
<li>The VENDEE(S) hereby agree to the members of the Society or Association to be registered under the Societies Act or any other analogous enactment or regulations that may be formed by all the Flat Owners of the building complex “ANANDA THE DRIZZLE” and the VENDEE(S) shall abide by the rules and bye-laws of the said society who shall be the administrators of common services such as lift, transformer, corridors, passages, staircases, drainage, water supply, maintenances of bore wells, electricity and other properties of common enjoyment and maintenance of security staff and any such other welfare activities as the general body of society may consider and resolve by a special resolution. The VENDEE(S) shall pay to the Society/Association share of the amounts towards common services, insurance premium, taxes livable on the entire building complex. Further, the VENDEE(S) shall pay the Property Tax, electricity consumption charges and water charges of Scheduled “B” Property etc., to the concerned authorities regularly.</li>
<li>The VENDEE(S) shall park his/her vehicle only at designated/allotted parking space and the drive ways/common passage shall be used for proper ingress and egress to the building complex. And the said common drive ways/passage shall not be obstructed or occupied in any manner.</li>
<li>The VENDEE(S) hereby agree to use the common over head tank jointly along with other Flat Owners and undertakes to pay the water charges proportionately if water is purchased.</li>
<li>The VENDEE(S) hereby agree that they shall not use the Flat for any purpose which may cause nuisance or disturbance to the neighboring occupants of the building or for any illegal or immoral purpose.</li>
<li>If any water problem arises due to insufficient depth of the present bore well, the VENDEE(S) hereby agreed to share proportionately the expenses/cost incurred for increasing the depth of the present Bore-well or for digging new Bore-well. The Vendor will not be responsible for the same and all the Flat Owners of the building shall collectively bear the same.</li>
<li>The VENDEE(S) shall not store in the Flat any explosive or goods of destructive nature which are likely to cause, fire or explosion and also shall not store heavy weight materials which may affect damage or destroy the structures of the building.</li>
<li>WHEREAS, all the Flat Owners / members of the Club House / Society of “ANANDA THE DRIZZLE” project shall have equal rights on the Club House and are equally entitled to enjoy the proceeds of the Club House.  All the members of the Club House shall entitle to enjoy the facilities, infrastructure, manpower etc., equally without any exception or partiality.</li>
</ol>
